みんな笑顔になれ！ わんつーで参拝 みこみこみこ！
Everyone, wear a smile! One, two, bow and pray, Miko Miko Miko!

96
00:08:52,345 --> 00:08:54,055
この曲、聴いてくれて
Thank you for listening to this song,

97
00:08:54,055 --> 00:08:57,395
本当にありがとう…！
Thank you so much...!

98
00:08:58,925 --> 00:09:01,395
わんつーで参拝 みこみこみこ！
One, two, bow and pray, Miko Miko Miko!

99
00:09:09,165 --> 00:09:11,735
最後も参拝 みこみこみこ！イエーイ！
Final prayer, Miko Miko Miko! Yeah!

100
00:09:12,535 --> 00:09:13,535
おしまい！
That's the end!

101
00:09:13,535 --> 00:09:16,365
みんなありがとう！
Thank you everyone!

102
00:10:02,291 --> 00:10:03,431
はぁ ということで
Phew... So,

103
00:10:03,751 --> 00:10:05,551
皆さん
everyone,

104
00:10:05,711 --> 00:10:09,311
お久しぶりの方は…どうも、お久しぶりです。
for those it's been a while... hello, it's been a while.

105
00:10:11,641 --> 00:10:14,341
だめだめ、最初はね、だめだよ。
No, no, at first, no, I can't do it.

106
00:10:15,901 --> 00:10:17,501
ちょっと待って。
Hold on...

107
00:10:24,121 --> 00:10:25,341
はい、皆さん！
Hi, everyone!

108
00:10:26,511 --> 00:10:33,071
初めましての人は…初めまして！
For those meeting me for the first time... nice to meet you!

109
00:10:33,071 --> 00:10:36,171
さくらみこです！えにこみこの…さくらみこです！
I'm Sakura Miko! Eniko Miko's... Sakura Miko!

110
00:10:38,401 --> 00:10:45,401
本当に、本当にたくさん待ってくれて、どうもありがとうございました。
Thank you so much for waiting for me for so, so long.

111
00:10:49,071 --> 00:10:53,271
えみこは、3ヶ月半…ぐらいかな？
Emiko was... about 3 and a half months, I guess?

112
00:10:54,731 --> 00:10:58,431
ちょっとだけ…ちょっとじゃない、長い間ね、
For a little while... no, not a little, for a long time,

113
00:10:58,791 --> 00:11:08,191
配信もお休みして…急ように開けてくれて、みんなをほっといて…本当にごめんなさい！
I took a break from streaming... opening up so suddenly and leaving everyone hanging... I am truly sorry!

114
00:11:08,751 --> 00:11:12,951
そして…ありがとうございます！
And... thank you so much!

115
00:11:13,851 --> 00:11:18,451
今日もね、支えてくれたこのライブのメンバーも、
Today as well, supporting me, the members of this live,

116
00:11:18,761 --> 00:11:27,161
みこぴーも、今見てくれてるこのライブのファンの方も、初めてしてくれた方も、
Mikopii as well, the fans watching this live right now, those meeting me for the first time,

117
00:11:27,161 --> 00:11:31,461
スタッフさんも、お母さんも…
the staff, my mom...

118
00:11:31,911 --> 00:11:47,011
今日までたくさん迷惑をかけて、心配かけて…それでも、この先まで元気に活動できるようにと、給料を取らせて…もらっていました。
up until today, causing so much trouble and worry... even so, wishing that I can continue my activities energetically moving forward, I was allowed to take a salary... receive it.

119
00:11:47,951 --> 00:11:53,451
そして今日！待望の、待ちに待った復帰ライブ！
And today! The long-awaited, eagerly awaited return live!

120
00:11:54,101 --> 00:12:02,301
めっちゃ緊張してるけど、ダンスも下手だったかな？まあ、リトだけど…今日も頑張ったんだけど。そう。
I'm super nervous, but was my dance bad too? Well, it's lito... but I did my best today. Yeah.

121
00:12:08,491 --> 00:12:15,691
今日は精一杯、復帰を楽しんでいきたいと思います！コメント見れないよー。
Today I want to enjoy my return to the fullest! I can't see the comments.

122
00:12:16,451 --> 00:12:18,451
はあ、ありがとうみんな！
Phew, thank you everyone!

123
00:12:18,791 --> 00:12:26,191
ホロライブ！ホロライブのメイジ、エリートみこ、センキュー！ああ、アーユルヴェーダ！ウォー！
Hololive! Hololive's mage, elite Miko, thank you! Ah, Ayurveda! Whoa!

124
00:12:28,161 --> 00:12:33,961
ああ、楽しいね！久しぶりに会うと…なんか緊張する。
Ah, it's fun! Seeing you after such a long time... I feel kind of nervous.

125
00:12:33,961 --> 00:12:37,461
でも、本当にありがとう。あ、みこ声変わってない？大丈夫？
But, thank you so much. Ah, has Miko's voice changed? Is it okay?

126
00:12:37,461 --> 00:12:40,761
どうと…なんか、大丈夫？大丈夫かな。
Huh... somehow, is it okay? Is it okay, I wonder.

127
00:12:41,971 --> 00:12:56,271
ということで、それではね、この後…どんどん…どんどん…お、おいかかわんないけど、何曲か歌わせてもらえます。
So, well then, after this... more and more... more and more... oh, I don't know why, but I'll get to sing a few songs.

128
00:12:56,821 --> 00:13:02,921
頑張る！頑張るから、みんなよかったら最後まで見てください。
I'll do my best! I'll do my best, so everyone, if you'd like, please watch until the end.

129
00:13:02,921 --> 00:13:13,421
そして、え、最後のほうには…お知らせも…ある！あるんだよ。なので、楽しみに…しててください。
And, um, towards the end... there's also... an announcement! There is. So please look forward to it.

130
00:13:15,301 --> 00:13:19,401
ああ、ニコユーズで、はい！
Ah, Nico users, yes!

131
00:13:21,831 --> 00:13:27,431
ということで、それでは次の曲、行っていいですか？
So with that, shall we go to the next song?

132
00:13:30,971 --> 00:13:33,671
おいおい、楽しみだよ！
Oh boy, I'm looking forward to it!

133
00:13:34,101 --> 00:13:38,101
はい、楽しみにしてくれてるということで！
Yes, since you're looking forward to it!

134
00:13:39,871 --> 00:13:44,171
それでは、復帰ライブ始めたいと思います！
Well then, I'd like to start the return live!

135
00:13:44,961 --> 00:13:51,661
まず1曲目は…マスターピース！
First, the first song is... MASTERPIECE!

136
00:13:56,816 --> 00:14:03,616
M@STERPIECE 作詞：yura 作曲：神前暁
M@STERPIECE | Lyrics: yura | Music: Satoru Kosaki

137
00:14:43,797 --> 00:14:48,107
さあ今を輝け!!
Now, shine in the present!!

138
00:14:48,357 --> 00:14:52,467
YES→幾つもの思い出達
YES→Countless memories

139
00:14:52,887 --> 00:14:56,297
眩しい今日の光へ
Toward today's dazzling light

140
00:14:56,517 --> 00:15:00,627
さあ今を羽ばたけ!!
Now, take flight into the present!!

141
00:15:07,062 --> 00:15:10,732
夢をはじめて寝かせて 今日までどのくらい経っただろう
I first let my dream sleep—wondering how much time has passed until today.

142
00:15:10,992 --> 00:15:15,162
ずっと一日ずつ 繋げようよ
Let's keep connecting it, one day at a time.

143
00:15:15,432 --> 00:15:18,052
歌いたいから
Because I want to sing,

144
00:15:18,052 --> 00:15:20,912
踊りたいから
because I want to dance,

145
00:15:21,072 --> 00:15:25,142
新しい幕を開けようね Maeveへ
let's open a new curtain toward the future—

146
00:15:25,402 --> 00:15:28,262
愛のDiamond
with a diamond of love,

147
00:15:28,412 --> 00:15:30,992
Masterpiece
our masterpiece.

148
00:15:31,192 --> 00:15:35,222
夢をはじめて寝かせて 今日までどのくらい経っただろう
I first let my dream sleep—wondering how much time has passed until today.

149
00:15:35,472 --> 00:15:41,722
ずっと一日ずつ 繋げようよ
Let's keep connecting it, one day at a time.

150
00:15:42,142 --> 00:15:45,252
夢は自分を叶える
Dreams make ourselves come true,

151
00:15:45,672 --> 00:15:49,702
たまに生まれた証だから
as proof that we were born this way.

152
00:15:49,962 --> 00:15:56,904
きっと この心で 私のMasterpiece
Surely, right here in this heart, is my masterpiece.

153
00:16:20,062 --> 00:16:22,932
ねぇ 逢えてよかった
Hey, I'm so glad we met.

154
00:16:23,592 --> 00:16:27,012
ねぇ あなたに言葉言うなら
Hey, if I were to put it into words for you,

155
00:16:27,012 --> 00:16:33,332
ありのままと そして よろしくスマイル
just be as you are, and keep a smiling face.

156
00:16:33,692 --> 00:16:37,712
みんなでいても たった一人でいても
Whether we're together or completely alone,

157
00:16:37,922 --> 00:16:45,642
輝きの向こう側へ 進め All right!
let's push forward beyond the radiance—all right!

158
00:16:50,872 --> 00:16:57,422
明日はどんな日になるか 誰だって分からないけれど
Nobody knows what kind of day tomorrow will bring,

159
00:16:58,792 --> 00:17:06,002
それはどんな秘密の出来事
whatever secret events await us.

160
00:17:06,342 --> 00:17:13,792
明日は追いかけて雲のじゃなくて 今へと変えてくもの
Tomorrow isn't just something to chase, but something we turn into the present.

161
00:17:14,022 --> 00:17:22,062
それが自分になる 私がマスターピース
That becomes who I am—my own masterpiece.

162
00:17:25,662 --> 00:17:29,372
みんなのおかげで 戻って来てくれました！
Thanks to everyone, I was able to come back!

163
00:17:29,922 --> 00:17:38,942
それは支えてくれた コロネースのみんな、３期生ののみんな、そして今見てくれてるみんなのおかげです！
That's thanks to everyone who supported me, my 3rd-gen peers, and all of you watching right now!

164
00:17:39,382 --> 00:17:43,422
今日のライブ 楽しんでってねー！
Please enjoy today's live concert!

165
00:18:01,332 --> 00:18:04,032
歌いたいから
Because I want to sing,

166
00:18:04,282 --> 00:18:07,062
踊りたいから
because I want to dance,

167
00:18:07,332 --> 00:18:11,432
新しい幕を開けようね Maeveへ
let's open a new curtain toward the future—

168
00:18:11,682 --> 00:18:14,462
愛のDiamond
with a diamond of love,

169
00:18:14,702 --> 00:18:20,572
Masterpiece
our masterpiece.

170
00:18:21,032 --> 00:18:25,412
夢をはじめて寝かせて 今日までどのくらい経っただろう
I first let my dream sleep—wondering how much time has passed until today.

171
00:18:25,672 --> 00:18:34,132
ずっと一日ずつ 繋げようよ
Let's keep connecting it, one day at a time.

172
00:18:35,632 --> 00:18:39,432
夢は自分を叶える
